  "system": {
    "description": "<p>A swirling vortex of sand and dust surrounds you.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, each creature within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of you (including you) has <strong>Total Cover</strong> against any creature that is not adjacent to it. Creatures at opposite ends of the dust cloud have <strong>Total Cover</strong> against each other.</p><p>At the start of your turn, you can move each creature other than yourself within the dust cloud by <strong>1 space</strong>, as it becomes disoriented by the swirling mass surrounding you.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.ZefT2hKteSddWgnv]{Dust Storm}</p>",
